gsipper (1.0.4-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Reconnect now does a real reconnect: tears down the pjsua2
    Account and rebuilds it through configure_account, so a fresh
    REGISTER actually goes on the wire. The previous
    setRegistration(True)-only path short-circuited inside PJSIP
    when the existing registration was still valid.

